        "created_at": "2018-02-04T23:50:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’d argue that it only applies when the bonus/penalty is removed by an outside force, usually by giving the target a hinder/boost that’s greater than or equal to the original by affecting the device/bot unity made.</p><p><span>I.e. the new knife unity made for Wraith is stolen by the pteradactyl thief, or Baron Blade blasts off the alterations unity made to his armor.</span></p>",
