        "id": 213850,
        "name": "Gislef",
        "username": "Gislef",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/4af34b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-02-07T17:12:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hmmm. Was still curious why Absolute Zero needs Freezer Burn to get him to Yellow quicker (per Christopher above), since his Yellow powers don't seem any better than anyone else's. And he already has the inherent Risky Action to get to Yellow faster and do Max rather than Mid damage to his opponents. Or do Mid damage and take no damage, with just his basic Cold attack.</p><p>Anyone?</p><p>If not, I'll have to wing it at tonight's demo session. Or hope that the players who asked last week don't show up tonight. :)</p><p>Or should I create a \"Absolute Zero questions, unifed\" thread? and repost there?</p>",
